			PRINTFORML [{LOCAL,2}] %CSVNAME(DITEMTYPE:(LOCAL):페르소나("NO"),0),20,LEFT%　LV:{DITEMTYPE:LOCAL:페르소나("LV"),3}　소지자:\@DITEMTYPE:(LOCAL):페르소나("ペルソナ所持者") >= 0 ? %CALLNAME:FINDCHARA_ID(DITEMTYPE:(LOCAL):페르소나("ペルソナ所持者")),20,LEFT% # %"없음",20,LEFT%\@
